# The Dockerfile needs only the Inkless distribution tarball and patch_kafka.sh
# from the build context. Exclude the rest of the multi-GB Inkless submodule
# (full Kafka source + every module's build/ output) so it isn't uploaded to
# buildx on every CI build. Docker cannot re-include a file whose parent dir is
# excluded, so whitelist the whole parent chain down to distributions.
inkless/**
!inkless/core
!inkless/core/build
!inkless/core/build/distributions
!inkless/core/build/distributions/**
